    "kind": "theorem",
    "title": {
      "type": "i18n",
      "default_language": "zh-CN",
      "values": {
        "zh-CN": "维数等于基的基数",
        "en": "Dimension equals the cardinality of a basis"
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "snl": "variable(__list__(Type.annotation(@$\\mathbb{K}$,Type),Type.annotation(@V,Type),LA.Field($\\mathbb{K}$),LA.VectorSpace(V,$\\mathbb{K}$),Type.annotation(@ι,Type),Type.annotation(@hf,$\\mathrm{Fintype}\\ \\iota$),Type.annotation(@b,Module.Basis(ι,$\\mathbb{K}$,V))),theorem($\\dim_{\\mathbb{K}} V = \\operatorname{card} \\iota \\quad (b : \\mathrm{Basis}\\ \\iota\\ \\mathbb{K}\\ V)$))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "zh-CN",
        "values": {
          "zh-CN": "若 $b$ 是以 $\\iota$ 为索引的基，则 $\\dim_{\\mathbb{K}} V=|\\iota|$；特别地任意两组有限基等势。",
          "en": "If $b$ is an $\\iota$-indexed basis then $\\dim_{\\mathbb{K}} V=|\\iota|$; in particular any two finite bases have the same cardinality."
        }
      }
    },
